<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   42.54		 42.58</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	71.30		 71.40</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 28.30		 28.35</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.382		 0.384</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.34		 11.36</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.60		 11.62</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.12		  1.14</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 6.20 pct	    6.40 pct</p>
